---
import ExamLayout from '../layouts/ExamLayout.astro';
---

<ExamLayout
  title="About ExamStatus"
  description="Learn how ExamStatus tracks and verifies government exam notifications, admit cards, and results across India."
>
  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">About ExamStatus</h1>

    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      ExamStatus is an independent tracking dashboard built to help students and job aspirants across India
      keep up with government exam notifications, admit card releases, and result announcements — all in one
      place, without needing to check dozens of individual recruitment board websites separately.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">What we cover</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      We track notifications from central recruitment bodies — including SSC, UPSC, Railway Recruitment
      Boards (RRB), IBPS and other banking exams, and Defense entrance exams — alongside state-level Public
      Service Commissions and recruitment boards. Coverage is expanding state by state over time.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">How we verify information</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      Every listing links directly to the official recruiting authority's website or notification. We aim to
      keep dates, vacancy counts, and eligibility details accurate and current, but this site is an
      informational aggregator, not an official government source — always confirm final details on the
      official notification before applying or making decisions.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">Have feedback?</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      Use the "Feedback" button in the corner of any page to report an error, request an exam or state we
      don't cover yet, or suggest an improvement. We read every submission.
    </p>
  </div>
</ExamLayout>
